# SEED Platform (always)

This repository is the **SEED Platform**: a website for **long-term attention** on a **product** or **KOL knowledge**.

## Core definition

- **SEED** = a cumulative **knowledge book** (professional knowledge asset a person/product accumulates).
- Users and others may **follow, arrange, share**, and later apply **commercial** models (subscribe, unlock, licensing).
- **AI tools directory** and **SmartDoc** are **collector/editor tools** whose job is to help **output SEEDs** — not the product itself.

## Do / Don't

- DO frame features as: discover → collect → edit → publish/share a SEED.
- DO keep Markdown as the portable SEED body format unless the user asks otherwise.
- DO NOT treat the editor, P2P demo, or catalog search as the north-star product.
- DO NOT confuse technical content-hash `seed` / `sd_…` inside SmartDoc with the product concept **SEED** (knowledge book). When unclear, prefer the product meaning and name the hash “content id” / “edition fingerprint”.
- **Default collaboration**: only edit Markdown; use Traditional Chinese for new/updated docs. Change code or deploy **only** when the owner explicitly says 改程式 / 發布（see `md-first-workflow.mdc`).
- When the user says publish/部署/上線 **after** asking for code changes (or says both), ship so the live site matches docs.

## Layout reminder

- Hub + AI catalog: `web/`
- SmartDoc source: `smartdoc-ai/` → build to `web/smartdoc/`
- Vision source of truth: `docs/00-seed-platform.md`
- **Status dashboard (what works / gaps / owner attention): `docs/STATUS.md`**
  - After meaningful feature work or when the user asks “what’s left / what’s wrong”, update `docs/STATUS.md`.
  - Do not claim the catalog MVP “98% done” as the whole platform.
